Package: a3-update
Version: 0
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Rafjagger
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Depends: python3, gpgv
Recommends: sudo
Description: A3 update, each machine's updater for a signed A3 release
 A user service (a3-update.service) that installs the A3 packages of this
 machine from a release of a3-system when Core asks: it downloads the
 release's .debs for this machine, checks them against the signed
 SHA256SUMS and hands them to the root helper /usr/lib/a3-update/a3-root,
 which checks the signature with the A3 key, installs and holds them.
 .
 Root only through one sudoers line, written once by hand, never by the
 package: aaa ALL=(root) NOPASSWD: /usr/lib/a3-update/a3-root install-release *
